            "detailed_description": "<strong>Sign In again.</strong><br>Remember a time before Facebook and Skype? When Windows XP was the next big thing and AIM was king. Relive that era with Emily is Away. Create a screenname and browse buddy infos in this chat-bot meets adventure game. Explore your relationship with Emily, a fellow high school student, in a branching narrative where you choose the outcome. And most importantly, change your text color to lime green so people know you're the coolest kid in school.<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>    Buddy icons, profiles and away messages.<br></li><li>    A dialogue decision-based branching narrative.<br></li><li>    Over an hour of nostalgia-inducing gameplay.<br></li><li>    Five chapters spanning five years of the main characters life.<br></li><li>    Computer sounds you hoped to never hear again!</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<strong>Sign In again.</strong><br>Remember a time before Facebook and Skype? When Windows XP was the next big thing and AIM was king. Relive that era with Emily is Away. Create a screenname and browse buddy infos in this chat-bot meets adventure game. Explore your relationship with Emily, a fellow high school student, in a branching narrative where you choose the outcome. And most importantly, change your text color to lime green so people know you're the coolest kid in school.<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>    Buddy icons, profiles and away messages.<br></li><li>    A dialogue decision-based branching narrative.<br></li><li>    Over an hour of nostalgia-inducing gameplay.<br></li><li>    Five chapters spanning five years of the main characters life.<br></li><li>    Computer sounds you hoped to never hear again!</li></ul>",
            "short_description": "Emily is Away is an interactive story. Create a screenname and choose your path through the branching narrative.",
